<title>SINGAPORE: TENNIS-SINGAPORE OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SINGAPORE OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results at the men's</p>
<p>Singapore Open tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Greg Rusedski (Britain) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
